# Never touch line endings.
#
# The repository holds both conventions: jukebox.html and style.css came over
# from the original project with CRLF, everything written since uses LF. Letting
# git normalise would rewrite whole files on checkout or commit and bury real
# changes - an editor did exactly that to jukebox.html once, turning a one line
# edit into 1466. Storing the bytes as they are keeps diffs honest.
* -text
